<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Mitac April sales down 20.48 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Mitac April sales down 20.48 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitac International Corp, one of Taiwan's leading computer makers, said on Friday its April sales were down 20.48 percent to T$821.687 million from April 1996.</p>
<p>In January-April, Mitac's combined sales fell 11.96 percent to T$4.221 billion from the same period a year ago, a company statement said.</p>
<p>It did not give profit figures.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
